WEBVTT

00:11:57.753 --> 00:12:01.180
Mendoj se shumica e atyre do ishin 
me te lumtura dhe te shendetshme

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.195
dhe si te rritur,

00:12:03.195 --> 00:12:06.968
shume nga ato do ishin me te dobta.

00:12:06.968 --> 00:12:09.081
Do doja qe dikush te ma kish thene ate

00:12:09.081 --> 00:12:12.502
kur isha 13.

00:12:12.502 --> 00:12:14.508
Faleminderit.

00:12:14.508 --> 00:12:22.867
(Duartrokitje)